      </p>
      <div style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
        <a href="/about/" style="color:#a78bfa;font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#c4b5fd'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#a78bfa'">
